{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic stone stacking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and tactile feedback make every placement a calming challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/d1935064095d60d185c127f29637c99b.poster.avif?t=1757005472\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/d1935064095d60d185c127f29637c99b.webm?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/d1935064095d60d185c127f29637c99b.mp4?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative expression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your stones, choose the time of day, and build freely in sandbox mode or structured challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/62c72d74a38282b082981c0b5ad25ac8.poster.avif?t=1757005472\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/62c72d74a38282b082981c0b5ad25ac8.webm?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/62c72d74a38282b082981c0b5ad25ac8.mp4?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolving puzzle modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your balance and logic in unique modes like Tower by Numbers, Color Rules, and One Chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/8c333e201d3c076d5ff145f72be066e4.poster.avif?t=1757005472\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/8c333e201d3c076d5ff145f72be066e4.webm?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/8c333e201d3c076d5ff145f72be066e4.mp4?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere &amp; immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene visuals, ambient nature sounds, and photo mode for capturing peaceful moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/350aeace05e18905f36ac1d530c31e57.poster.avif?t=1757005472\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/350aeace05e18905f36ac1d530c31e57.webm?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/extras/350aeace05e18905f36ac1d530c31e57.mp4?t=1757005472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1598960?t=1757005472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/38897e6578dc0241e76534b02c33bd08da58ef16/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757005472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/d97585eddf9ef0c4940b2db56065ecc93cdfb610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757005472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1598960/d97585eddf9ef0c4940b2db56065ecc93cdfb610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757005472","